			</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"padding-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n			<table style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"width: 30px; vertical-align: top;\">3.</td>\r\n						<td style=\"line-height: 1.5\">At the said time and place of service as aforesaid I had a conversation with the person so served in words to the following effect: I said: “Are you David Jones as referred to in these documents?” He replied: “Yes I am.</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"padding-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n			<table style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"width: 30px; vertical-align: top;\">4.</td>\r\n						<td style=\"line-height: 1.5\">I have attained the age of sixteen years and I believe that the information contained in this Affidavit is true.</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"padding-top: 30px;\">\r\n			<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 18px; padding-bottom: 13px;\">\r\n						<p style=\"margin: 0; width: 100%;\"><span style=\"border-right: 100px solid transparent;\">Sworn by the Deponent</span></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td style=\"width: 50%; padding-right: 20%;\">\r\n						<p style=\"margin: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 18px;line-height: 2.5;\">\r\n						<p style=\"margin: 0; width: 100%;\">On</p>\r\n\r\n						<p style=\"margin: 0; width: 100%;\">At Belrose NSW</p>\r\n\r\n						<p style=\"margin: 0; width: 100%;\">Before me:</p>\r\n\r\n						<p style=\"margin: 0; width: 100%; padding-top: 12px;\">Justice of the Peace</p>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n			</td>\r\n