n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>225 George Street, Sydney</td>\r\n			<td>State NSW</td>\r\n			<td>Postcode 2000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>\r\n			<h2 id=\"part-c\">Part C</h2>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td><strong>Evidence</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Set out the facts divided into consecutively numbered paragraphs. Each paragraph should be confined to a distinct part of the subject matter.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Attach extra page(s) if you need more space. Make sure that the page containing the signature (Part D or E) is always the last page of the form. You and the witness to your affidavit must sign the bottom of each additional page.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>\r\n			<ol type=\"1\">\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>I, Douglas O’Connor, Process Server of Associated Process Servers, Level 15, Grosvenor Place, 225 George Street, Sydney NSW 2000 say on oath:</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>I am the Process Server acting on behalf of the lawyers for the Applicant and I am authorised to make this affidavit on behalf of the Applicant.</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>I have attempted to serve the Respondent with the following documents:</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n			</ol>\r\n\r\n			<ol type=\"a\">\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>Application for Divorce</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>Affidavit for eFiling</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>Brochure – Marriage Families &amp; Separation</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n			</ol>\r\n\r\n			<ol start=\"4\" type=\"1\">\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>I attended at 4 Wilfrid Street, Macquarie Fields NSW 2564 as follows:</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n			</ol>\r\n\r\n			<ol type=\"a\">\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>21 October 2025 at 11:24am – I received no response from repeated knocking at the front door of the property.</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>22 October 2025 at 3:05pm – I met with a male adult occupant of the property, short height, greying beard, average build) who stated in words to the effect “I was previously a friend of Suvam but I have not had contact with him for some time. He does not live here. I had a contact phone number for him but it is now disconnected. I have no idea where he is or how to contact him.”</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n			</ol>\r\n\r\n			<ol start=\"5\" type=\"1\">\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>I have also attempted to contact the Respondent on his mobile telephone number of 0451 645 166, as provided to me by my instructing lawyers, but the same consistently responds with a generic message stating that the number is now disconnected.</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n			</ol>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>\r\n			<h2 id=\"part-d\">Part D</h2>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td><strong>Signature</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>I ☐ swear / ☐ affirm the contents of this affidavit are true</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>Signature of Deponent</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"even\">\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>Place Belrose NSW Date 04/11/2025</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"even\">\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>Before me (signature of witness)</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"even\">\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p>Delinda De Laurier</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>Full name of witness (please print)</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"even\">\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p>Justice of the Peace (JP #258854)</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>Notary public</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>Lawyer</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>Other authorised person (specify)      </p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>This affidavit was prepared / settled by deponent/s</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr class=\"header\">\r\n			<th>lawyer</th>\r\n			<th>     </th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>     </td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"even\">\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>PRINT NAME AND LAWYER’S CODE</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>\r\n			<h2 id=\"part-e\">Part E</h2>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td><strong>Alternative jurat for non-English speaking affidavit</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>Use this alternative jurat for the swearing/affirming of the affidavit and the interpreter/translator’s certificate.<br />\r\nSee r 17.13 of the Rules.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Interpreter/translator’s certification</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr class=\"header\">\r\n			<th>I</th>\r\n			<th>     </th>\r\n			<th>certify that I understand the English language and the</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"even\">\r\n			<td>     </td>\r\n			<td>language, and that I have truly interpreted to the</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"even\">\r\n			<td>deponent (named in Part B) the contents of this affidavit and the oath or affirmation which was administered.</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>Signature of interpreter</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>Date    /   /    </td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>☐ Sworn / ☐ affirmed by the deponent through the interpretation of:</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr class=\"header\">\r\n			<th>Interpreter’s full name</th>\r\n			<th>&nbsp;</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>     </td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"even\">\r\n			<td>Address</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>     </td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"even\">\r\n			<td>Language</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>     </td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>Signature of Deponent</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"even\">\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>Place      </td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>Date    /   /    </td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"even\">\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>Before me (signature of witness)</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p>     </p>\r\n\r\n			<p>Full name of witness (please print)</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"even\">\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p>Justice of the Peace (JP #     )</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>Notary public</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>Lawyer</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>Other authorised person (specify)      </p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>This affidavit was prepared / settled by deponent/s</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr class=\"header\">\r\n			<th>lawyer</th>\r\n			<th>     </th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>     </td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr class=\"even\">\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>PRINT NAME AND LAWYER’S CODE</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>0925V1</p>\r\n','','full_html'),('template',0,453,719,'en',0,'<!--?xml encoding=\"utf-8\" ?-->\r\n<p>IN THE HIGH COURT OF AUSTRALIA</p>\r\n\r\n<p>SYDNEY REGISTRY No. 5146 of 2017</p>\r\n\r\n<p>BETWEEN: ANITA RAJCANY</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Applicant</p>\r\n\r\n<p>and</p>\r\n\r\n<p>WILLIAM PETER TZANIS</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Respondent</p>\r\n\r\n<p>AFFIDAVIT OF SERVICE</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I, [node:field_client], of Level 25, Aurora Place, 88 Phillip Street, Sydney NSW 2000, Licensed Process Server, say on oath as follows:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol type=\"1\">\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>That I did on Thursday the 1<sup>st</sup> June 2017 at 2:05pm duly serve the above-named Respondent with an Application for Special Leave to Appeal filed on the 26<sup>th</sup> May 2017 together with Affidavit in Support of Leave Application filed on the 26<sup>th</sup> May 2017, true copies of which are annexed hereto marked “DOC1”, by delivering the same personally to William Peter Tzanis at 201 Bunnerong Road, Maroubra NSW 2035.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>At the same time and place of service as aforesaid I had a conversation with the person so served by me in words to the following effect:-</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>I said “Are you William Peter Tzanis as named in these documents?”</p>\r\n\r\n<p>He replied “Yes I am.”</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p>SWORN by the deponent</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>at Belrose in New South Wales</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>on the day of 2017.</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>Before me:</p>\r\n\r\n			<p><em>Signature</em></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p><em>Signature of deponent</em></p>\r\n\r\n			<p>______________________</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>IN THE HIGH COURT OF AUSTRALIA</p>\r\n\r\n<p>SYDNEY REGISTRY No. 5146 of 2017</p>\r\n\r\n<p>BETWEEN: ANITA RAJCANY</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Applicant</p>\r\n\r\n<p>and</p>\r\n\r\n<p>WILLIAM PETER TZANIS</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Respondent</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Affidavit of Douglas O’Connor sworn on the day of 2017</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>INDEX OF EXHIBITS</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p>EXHIBIT</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p>DESCRIPTION</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p>PARAGRAPH</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p>PAGE*</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p>“DOC1”</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p>Application for Special Leave to Appeal filed on 27 May 2017 and Affidavit in Support of Leave Application filed on 27 May 2017</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>IN THE HIGH COURT OF AUSTRALIA</p>\r\n\r\n<p>SYDNEY REGISTRY No. 5146 of 2017</p>\r\n\r\n<p>BETWEEN: ANITA RAJCANY</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Applicant</p>\r\n\r\n<p>and</p>\r\n\r\n<p>WILLIAM PETER TZANIS</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Respondent</p>\r\n\r\n<p>EXHIBIT “DOC1”</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is the exhibit marked DOC1 produced and shown to Douglas O’Connor at the time of swearing his affidavit this day of 2017.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Application for Special Leave to Appeal filed on 27 May 2017 and Affidavit in Support of Leave Application filed on 27 May 2017</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before me</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Solicitor/Justice of the Peace</p>\r\n','','full_html'),('template',0,454,723,'en',0,'<!--?xml encoding=\"utf-8\" ?-->\r\n<p><strong>ACT CIVIL AND ADMINISTRATIVE TRIBUNAL</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>IN THE ACT CIVIL &amp; )</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>ADMINISTRATIVE TRIBUNAL )</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p>………………………………………….</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Matter Number</strong></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>BETWEEN: ………………………………………….</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Applicant</p>\r\n\r\n<p>AND: ………………………………………….</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Respondent</p>\r\n\r\n<ol type=\"1\">\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Person serving documents</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>Full name: [node:field_served_by_first_name]</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Address:…………………………