body>\r\n								<tr>\r\n									<td>\r\n									<p style=\" font-weight: bold;margin-bottom: 0;padding: 10px 8px 8px; margin: 0;\">FILING DETAILS</p>\r\n									</td>\r\n								</tr>\r\n							</tbody>\r\n						</table>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"padding: 10px; padding-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n						<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;\">\r\n							<tbody>\r\n								<tr>\r\n									<td style=\" width: 40%; padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 10px;\">Filed for</td>\r\n									<td style=\" width: 60%; padding-left: 5px;padding-top: 10px;\">Plaintiff</td>\r\n								</tr>\r\n								<tr>\r\n									<td style=\"   width: 30%; padding-left: 5px;padding-top: 10px; vertical-align: top;\">Legal representative</td>\r\n									<td style=\"  width: 60%; padding-left: 5px;padding-top: 10px;\">Christopher Bryett, AR Walmsley &amp; Co<br />\r\n									Cnr George and Dight Streets<br />\r\n									Windsor NSW 2756</td>\r\n								</tr>\r\n								<tr>\r\n									<td style=\"border-top: 0;  width: 30%; padding-left: 5px;\">Legal representative reference</td>\r\n									<td style=\" width: 60%; padding-left: 5px;padding-top: 10px;\">CGB:PC:19265</td>\r\n								</tr>\r\n								<tr>\r\n									<td style=\"border-top: 0;  width: 30%; padding-left: 5px;\">Contact name and telephone</td>\r\n									<td style=\" width: 60%; padding-left: 5px;padding-top: 10px;\">Paul Cagliuso 02 4577 0100</td>\r\n								</tr>\r\n							</tbody>\r\n						</table>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<table style=\"width: 100%; margin: 0 auto;  border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0; font-size: 15px; \">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"padding: 0 10px 10px;\">\r\n						<table style=\"width: 100% ;border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;background-color: #C0C0C0;\">\r\n							<tbody>\r\n								<tr>\r\n									<td>\r\n									<p style=\" font-weight: bold;margin-bottom: 0;padding: 10px; margin: 0;\">AFFIDAVIT DETAILS</p>\r\n									</td>\r\n								</tr>\r\n							</tbody>\r\n						</table>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"padding: 0 10px;\">\r\n						<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;\">\r\n							<tbody>\r\n								<tr>\r\n									<td style=\"width: 30%;padding-left: 5px; padding-bottom: 6px;\">\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 6px;\">Name</p>\r\n									</td>\r\n									<td style=\"width: 70%;padding-left: 5px; padding-bottom: 6px;\">\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 6px;\">Douglas O’Connor</p>\r\n									</td>\r\n								</tr>\r\n								<tr>\r\n									<td style=\"width: 30%;padding-left: 5px; padding-bottom: 6px;\">\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 6px;\">Address</p>\r\n									</td>\r\n									<td style=\"width: 70%;padding-left: 5px; padding-bottom: 6px;\">\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 6px;\">Level 25, Aurora Place, 88 Phillip Street, Sydney NSW 2000</p>\r\n									</td>\r\n								</tr>\r\n								<tr>\r\n									<td style=\"width: 30%;padding-left: 5px; padding-bottom: 6px;\">\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 6px;\">Occupation</p>\r\n									</td>\r\n									<td style=\"width: 70%;padding-left: 5px; padding-bottom: 6px;\">\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 6px;\">Licensed Process Server</p>\r\n									</td>\r\n								</tr>\r\n								<tr>\r\n									<td style=\"width: 30%;padding-left: 5px; padding-bottom: 6px;\">\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 6px;\">Date</p>\r\n									</td>\r\n									<td style=\"width: 70%;padding-left: 5px; padding-bottom: 6px;\">\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 6px;\">29 September 2017</p>\r\n									</td>\r\n								</tr>\r\n							</tbody>\r\n						</table>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"padding: 0 10px;\">\r\n						<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;\">\r\n							<tbody>\r\n								<tr>\r\n									<td>\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 8px;\">I say on oath:</p>\r\n									</td>\r\n								</tr>\r\n								<tr>\r\n									<td style=\"padding-left: 30px; padding-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n									<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;\">\r\n										<tbody>\r\n											<tr>\r\n												<td style=\"width: 30px; vertical-align: top;\">1.</td>\r\n												<td style=\"line-height: 1.5\">I am over the age of 16 years.</td>\r\n											</tr>\r\n											<tr>\r\n												<td style=\"width: 30px; vertical-align: top;\">2.</td>\r\n												<td style=\"line-height: 1.5\">On Thursday the 28th September 2017 at 12:43pm at 20-44 Ennis Road, Milsons Point NSW 2061, I served Roads and Maritime Services with the following documents:</td>\r\n											</tr>\r\n											<tr>\r\n												<td style=\"width: 30px; vertical-align: top;\">(a)</td>\r\n												<td style=\"line-height: 1.5\">Summons filed on the 18th September 2017</td>\r\n											</tr>\r\n											<tr>\r\n												<td style=\"width: 30px; vertical-align: top;\">(b)</td>\r\n												<td style=\"line-height: 1.5\">Notice of Listing dated 20 September 2017</td>\r\n											</tr>\r\n											<tr>\r\n												<td style=\"width: 30px; vertical-align: top;\">(c)</td>\r\n												<td style=\"line-height: 1.5\">Affidavit of Jason Bousfield sworn on the 8th September 2017</td>\r\n											</tr>\r\n											<tr>\r\n												<td style=\"width: 30px; vertical-align: top;\">3.</td>\r\n												<td style=\"line-height: 1.5\">I served the documents by handing the same personally to Shareef Mohammed, a male employee apparently over the age of 16 years, at 20-44 Ennis Road, Milsons Point NSW 2061.</td>\r\n											</tr>\r\n											<tr>\r\n												<td style=\"width: 30px; vertical-align: top;\">4.</td>\r\n												<td style=\"line-height: 1.5\">At the said time and place of service I had a conversation with the person so served by me in words to the following effect:-</td>\r\n											</tr>\r\n										</tbody>\r\n									</table>\r\n									</td>\r\n								</tr>\r\n								<tr>\r\n									<td>\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 24px;\">I said: “Are you able to accept service of these documents on behalf of Roads and</p>\r\n\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 24px;\">Maritime Services as referred to therein?”</p>\r\n\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 20px; padding-left: 24px;\">He replied: “Yes, I am Shareef Mohammed, concierge for them.”</p>\r\n\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 8px;\">SWORN on</p>\r\n\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 8px;\">At</p>\r\n\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 8px;\">Signature of deponent</p>\r\n\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 8px; padding-bottom: 40px;\">Name of witness</p>\r\n									</td>\r\n								</tr>\r\n								<tr>\r\n									<td>\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 8px;\">Address of witness</p>\r\n\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 8px;\">Capacity of witness</p>\r\n\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 8px;\">And as a witness, I certify the following matters concerning the person who made</p>\r\n\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 8px;\">this affidavit (the deponent):</p>\r\n\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 12px;\"><span style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">1.</span> I saw the face of the deponent</p>\r\n\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 12px;\"><span style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">2.</span>I have confirmed the deponent’s identity using the following identification</p>\r\n\r\n									<p style=\"margin: 0; padding-bottom: 8px