n                        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; text-align: center; padding-top: 15px; padding-bottom: 15px;\">Certification of Service</p>\r\n\r\n                        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; text-align: left; padding-bottom: 15px;\">I certify service of documents in accordance with the above schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n                        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; text-align: left; padding-bottom: 15px;\">Signature: __________________________________ <span style=\"padding-left: 15px;\">Date:</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span>/</span> &nbsp;<span>/</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n                        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; text-align: left; padding-bottom: 15px;\">Name : ____________________________________</p>\r\n                        </td>\r\n                      </tr>\r\n                      <tr>\r\n                        <td colspan=\"5\" style=\"padding-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                        <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0; width:100%; margin: auto; font-size: 15px; border: 1px solid #000; padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n                          <tbody>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                              <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; padding: 4px 6px 10px;\">Lodgment Details</td>\r\n                            </tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                              <td style=\"text-align: left; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 6px;\">Hand delivery</td>\r\n                              <td style=\"text-align: left; padding: 4px 6px;\">Level 20, 1 Oxford Street Darlinghurst NSW 2010</td>\r\n                            </tr>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                              <td style=\"text-align: left; padding: 4px 6px; font-weight: bold;\">Postal address</td>\r\n                  