 Street, Sydney NSW 2000.</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0; width: 100%\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"width: 30px; vertical-align: top;\">4</td>\r\n						<td>At the said time and place of service I had a conversation with the person so served by me in words to the following effect:-</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<p style=\"margin: 0;\">I said: <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">“Are you able to accept service of these documents on behalf of the Defendant as shown therein?”</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"padding-bottom: 40px;\">\r\n			<p style=\"margin: 0;\">She replied:<span style=\"font-style: italic;\">“Yes, I am Amelia Butler, Head of Member Services for REST.”</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px; font-family: Times New Roman;\">\r\n			<p style=\"margin: 0; width: 100%;\">Sworn</p>\r\n\r\n			<p style=\"margin: 0; width: 100%;\">by the abovenamed deponent</p>\r\n\r\n			<p style=\"margin: 0; width: 100%;\">at <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">(place)</span></p>\r\n\r\n			<p style=\"margin: 0; width: 100%; padding-bottom: 20px;\">on <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">(date)</span></p>\r\n\r\n			<p style=\"margin: 0; width: 100%;\">……………………………………..</p>\r\n\r\n			<p style=\"margin: 0; width: 100%; padding-bottom: 10px;\">(<span style=\"font-style: italic; \">signature of deponent</span>)</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px; font-family: Times New Roman;\">\r\n			<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0; width: 100%;\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"width: 75px;\">before me</td>\r\n						<td>\r\n						<p style=\"margin: 0;\"><span style=\"padding-right: 10px;\">…………………………