rt-c\">Part C</h2>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td><strong>Evidence</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Set out the facts divided into consecutively numbered paragraphs. Each paragraph should be confined to a distinct part of the subject matter.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Attach extra page(s) if you need more space. Make sure that the page containing the signature (Part D or E) is always the last page of the form. You and the witness to your affidavit must sign the bottom of each additional page.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr class=\"odd\">\r\n			<td>\r\n			<ol type=\"1\">\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>I, Douglas O’Connor, Process Server of Associated Process Servers, Level 15, Grosvenor Place, 225 George Street, Sydney NSW 2000 say on oath:</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>I am the Process Server acting on behalf of the lawyers for the Applicant and I am authorised to make this affidavit on behalf of the Applicant.</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>I have attempted to serve the Respondent with the following documents:</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n			</ol>\r\n\r\n			<ol type=\"a\">\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>Application for Divorce</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>Affidavit for eFiling</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>Brochure – Marriage Families &amp; Separation</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n			</ol>\r\n\r\n			<ol start=\"4\" type=\"1\">\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>I attended at 4 Wilfrid Street, Macquarie Fields NSW 2564 as follows:</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n			</ol>\r\n\r\n			<ol type=\"a\">\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>21 October 2025 at 11:24am – I received no response from repeated knocking at the front door of the property.</p>\r\n				</li>\r\n				<li>\r\n				<p>22 October 2025 at 3:05pm – I met with a male adult occupant of the property, short height, greying beard, average build) who stated in words to the effect “I was previously a friend of Suvam but I have not had contact with him for some time. He does not live here. 